{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2.1-20260713-103018-2c0bfc93", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なお、その他サービスは概ね計画どおり進捗して", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783906281.6376698}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2.1-20260713-103018-2c0bfc93", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は十億六千百万円となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783906286.6551383}
