{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2.1-20260713-103018-2c0bfc93", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七点八", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783906298.2081652}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2.1-20260713-103018-2c0bfc93", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "8に向上しました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783906299.6135552}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2.1-20260713-103018-2c0bfc93", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。経常利益は十一億二千八百万円と", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783906304.6060228}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2.1-20260713-103018-2c0bfc93", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なり、前年同期比9。5の増益となりまた。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783906306.817962}
