{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2.1-20260713-103018-2c0bfc93", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "対応のない成果や", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783906356.1105132}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2.1-20260713-103018-2c0bfc93", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の定義といった毎期継続している費用削減の施策が", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783906360.264135}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2.1-20260713-103018-2c0bfc93", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "確実に低下を", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783906362.236456}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.2.1-20260713-103018-2c0bfc93", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "収益が概ね予算通りに推移する中", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783906365.5382826}
